+These have been deposited in an Open Storage Framework (OSF) repository
+[here](https://osf.io/5n4q3), and can be easily queried and downloaded 
+using functions from the `r BiocStyle::CRANpkg("osfr")` package.
+
+For convenience, we have implemented `OSTA.data` to:
+
+- retrieve a dataset from our OSF node
+- cache it as a *.zip* archive using `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("BiocFileCache")`
+- unpack and read it into a `SpatialExperiment`
+
+```{r osta-data, eval=FALSE}
+if (!require("BiocManager", quietly=TRUE))
+    install.packages("BiocManager")
+BiocManager::install("estellad/OSTA.data")
+```
+
+The following datasets are currently available:
+
+```{r list-data, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE}
+OSTA.data::.list_data()
 ```
 
